                <pb facs="0219" n="117" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg117"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 14911/8.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root directs Mr. Rockhill to convey to His Imperial Majesty the Emperor and
                    His Imperial Highness the Regent the deep regret and sincere sympathy of the
                    President, the Secretary of State, and the American people upon the death of His
                    Imperial Majesty the late Emperor and Her Imperial Majesty the late Empress
                    Dowager.)</p>
            </div>
